screenToWorld(clientX, clientY): {x: camera.x + clientX/scale, y: camera.y+clientY/scale} (camera.x is rendered incl shake). mouseWorld uses that.

camera update:
```
updateCamera(dt) {
 const p=this.player;
 let targetX, targetY;
